test_putc — minimal output test
=================================

Uses putc syscalls directly, no IPC. If this works but puts doesn't,
the problem is in IPC/VFS handle path.

    module oskit.bin.test_putc

    import oskit.ulib.{putc, exit}

    main(argv: []string)
        putc('O')
        putc('K')
        putc('\n')
        exit()
